{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/extras/c23c71c3f8d58de4f90ec69ffee779ca.poster.avif?t=1770470955\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/extras/c23c71c3f8d58de4f90ec69ffee779ca.webm?t=1770470955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/extras/c23c71c3f8d58de4f90ec69ffee779ca.mp4?t=1770470955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/extras/3d899599b77c0ba20a2e75f7264d64e0.avif?t=1770470955\" width=596 height=143 /></span><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Company \u2014 the corporation you work for. Some say they are a monopoly, a company with ambitions large enough to one day control the entire world. Maybe these are just rumors.<br>But one question remains: why is the pickup point located deep in the forest, far from the city and from people?<br><br>You work here, surrounded by silence and snow, handing out packages to those who come for them. And then, at some point, you start to realize you are not alone: someone is watching you.<br>Who is it\u2026 or what is it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/extras/f37f39425fa3c74c85c4fc5ba1eac0bc.poster.avif?t=1770470955\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/extras/f37f39425fa3c74c85c4fc5ba1eac0bc.webm?t=1770470955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/extras/f37f39425fa3c74c85c4fc5ba1eac0bc.mp4?t=1770470955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/extras/aab4f5336b50d88d12f907f6ca1708c4.avif?t=1770470955\" width=596 height=143 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to give orders to the visitors who come to this pickup point. Everything should be calm and routine \u2014 but don\u2019t forget to keep an eye on your sanity. Here, it\u2019s easy to lose.<br><br>And one more piece of advice: don\u2019t rush to drive people away, even if they seem strange. First impressions can be misleading \u2014 and some visitors may be far more important than they appear at first glance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/extras/d7f5e13e6817579a150cb18e63a103b5.poster.avif?t=1770470955\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/extras/d7f5e13e6817579a150cb18e63a103b5.webm?t=1770470955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/extras/d7f5e13e6817579a150cb18e63a103b5.mp4?t=1770470955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/extras/052a313904daa65cedf04322908e751f.avif?t=1770470955\" width=596 height=143 /></span><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You feel someone\u2019s <strong>gaze</strong> from outside \u2014 persistent, quiet, cold. Maybe it\u2019s just exhaustion\u2026 or maybe it\u2019s real.<br><br>The enormous warehouse nearby only raises more questions. What is The Company hiding?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> The answers are here \u2014 but are you ready to face them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/extras/1322df6e9c5b823c34a668b112453f7d.poster.avif?t=1770470955\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/extras/1322df6e9c5b823c34a668b112453f7d.webm?t=1770470955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/extras/1322df6e9c5b823c34a668b112453f7d.mp4?t=1770470955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4036290?t=1770470955","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/7646347c04666778e6ddd1193cbc7347e93c4a67/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770470955","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/e36c47f3715dc57499577c28d7a8aa0c0d17414b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770470955","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036290/e36c47f3715dc57499577c28d7a8aa0c0d17414b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770470955","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"f